{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065485/block/singleImage/3276745/wm/01M86G1TKHGH0BEG3JJN8QTEJX.jpg?updatedAt=1795514810\"/><figcaption>嘉熙1122伙全數沽清 壓軸複式戶3800萬售出</figcaption></figure><p>由嘉華國際（173）發展、已屆現樓的大埔白石角「嘉熙」，今日（24日）成功售出項目最後一伙壓軸特色單位，標誌全盤正式沽清。 是次成交單位為第7座20及21樓C室頂層複式戶，實用面積1,653方呎，採三房三套房間隔，外連236方呎平台及754方呎天台。據悉，單位獲區內實力換樓客斥資3,800萬元連同兩個車位一併購入，平均呎價22,989元。 資料顯示，嘉熙位於大埔半山科進路16號，2019年入伙，共有9座，提供1,122個單位。 即睇大埔嘉熙放盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:44:14.975434+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:06:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:57:15.548414+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:37:16.828414+00:00","content_hash":"dadf411fab3032ce89cdcf2ebd7d7233e11d667dbf3f6de5609c470d84e2aef4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:44:14.975434+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}